OL,3,GNEWSADarkness star 'angry' sea could
OL,4,Atake parents' home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lead singer of The Darkness is
OL,7,F"angry" his parents have been advised
OL,8,Fto move out of their home after being
OL,9,Ftold nearby coastal defences will not
OL,10,Fbe renewed.
OL,12,FJustin Hawkins said East Suffolk
OL,13,FCouncil had informed his parents, who
OL,14,Flive in the village of Corton, near
OL,15,FLowestoft, Suffolk, their house was at
OL,16,Frisk of being lost to the sea.
OL,18,FHawkins told the BBC he had been left
OL,19,F"emotional" and did not think it was
OL,20,F"good enough" that they had been
OL,21,Foffered a plot of land elsewhere.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
